{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19264","headline":"许给事见示哭工部刘尚书诗因命同作 · 刘禹锡","name":"许给事见示哭工部刘尚书诗因命同作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉室贤王後，孔门高第人。\n济时成国器，乐道任天真。\n特达圭无玷，坚贞竹有筠。\n总戎宽得衆，市义贵能贫。\n护塞无南牧，驰心拱北辰。\n乞身来阙下，赐告卧漳滨。\n荣耀初题劒，清羸已拖绅。\n宫星徒列位，隙日不回轮。\n自昔追飞侣，今爲侍从臣。\n素弦哀已绝，青简叹犹新。\n未遂挥金乐，空悲撤瑟晨。\n凄凉竹林下，无复见清尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}